==================================================

PRSL-AI should use:

ONE AUTHORITATIVE SOURCE

and:

MANY DERIVED REPRESENTATIONS.

Example:

Canonical Memory
↓
Search Index
↓
Embedding
↓
Cache
↓
Context Projection

The derived representations may become stale.

The canonical Memory remains authoritative.

