69. FINAL STATEMENT
==================================================

The PRSL-AI Data Model exists to ensure that intelligence does not become synonymous with uncontrolled data accumulation.

PRSL-AI should remember intentionally.

Process minimally.

Persist purposefully.

Share selectively.

Verify consistently.

Delete appropriately.

And always preserve the distinction between temporary context, persistent memory, knowledge, execution state and authoritative system data.

The objective is not to store everything.

The objective is to maintain exactly the information required to provide useful, continuous, secure and human-centered intelligence.

